{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Curse of Grandfather</strong> is a short but intense psychological horror experience.<br>Late at night, you return to your grandfather\u2019s old house a place you haven\u2019t visited in years.<br>But something has changed. Every room carries a memory from the past, and every silence hides a whisper that shouldn\u2019t exist.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also <strong>uses your microphone</strong> to enhance immersion your voice can trigger certain events and increase tension throughout the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the dark secrets, you must find notes, keys, and mysterious books. But be careful\u2026 you are not alone in this place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-45 minute atmospheric horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal events and exploration-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but engaging puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone interaction: your voice can trigger certain events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design and tension-filled atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, cinematic visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the darkness.<br>But remember\u00a0<strong>this house is waiting for you... and it won\u2019t let you leave.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137730?t=1762784251","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4137730?t=1762784251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137730/84504e92c016c0a87e51872b950bc5ffe3d47faf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762784251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4137730/84504e92c016c0a87e51872b950bc5ffe3d47faf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762784251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains violence, blood, and horror themes that may be disturbing to some players.\r\nIt features dark environments, jump scares, and intense situations."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Curse of Grandfather</strong> is a short but intense psychological horror experience.<br>Late at night, you return to your grandfather\u2019s old house a place you haven\u2019t visited in years.<br>But something has changed. Every room carries a memory from the past, and every silence hides a whisper that shouldn\u2019t exist.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also <strong>uses your microphone</strong> to enhance immersion your voice can trigger certain events and increase tension throughout the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To uncover the dark secrets, you must find notes, keys, and mysterious books. But be careful\u2026 you are not alone in this place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-45 minute atmospheric horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paranormal events and exploration-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but engaging puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Microphone interaction: your voice can trigger certain events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design and tension-filled atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, cinematic visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the darkness.<br>But remember\u00a0<strong>this house is waiting for you... and it won\u2019t let you leave.</strong></p>","developers":["MED Game"],